    {
      "id": "53540a4d-f7cc-5e11-9548-6933caadd189",
      "name": "KrishAdmin-HQ guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# KrishAdmin-HQ \u2014 Local AI Router\n\n**Manual use:** edit `Example request`, choose tier `fast` or `reasoning`, then Execute Workflow.\n\n**Reusable:** call this workflow with `{ \"tier\": \"fast\", \"prompt\": \"...\" }`.\n\n**fast:** nvidia-gpu, local HTTPS; token and trusted certificate required. Model will be verified after connection.\n\n**reasoning:** dual AMD-GPU, ZeroTier VPN, Qwen 2.5 72B.\n\nFixed backend URLs; credentials are encrypted in n8n. TLS verification stays enabled. No shell commands or infrastructure changes. No automatic cross-backend retry. Inference runs only when requested.",
        "height": 430,
        "width": 460
      },
      "position": [
        0,
        -500
      ]
